  "description": "Chicken Rescue is a retro-inspired 2D pixel art platformer where a brave chicken sets out on an adventure to rescue lost chicks and recover valuable diamonds across challenging stages.\n\nRun, jump, glide, and overcome levels filled with enemies, traps, and cleverly designed obstacles. In each stage, players can save up to three lost chicks by opening the cages at the end, rewarding exploration and precise platforming skills.\n\nCollect diamonds scattered throughout the journey and gather eggs to use as ranged attacks against enemies. Defeat foes by jumping on them or attacking from a distance while mastering responsive controls and smooth movement. Hold the jump button to glide through the air, allowing you to avoid hazards, reach hidden paths, and explore new areas.\n\nWith detailed pixel art visuals and nostalgic 8-bit inspired music, Chicken Rescue blends classic platforming gameplay with modern level design, offering a fun and rewarding experience for both casual players and platforming fans.\n\nKey Features:\n- Classic 2D precision platforming gameplay\n- Rescue lost chicks in every level\n- Collect diamonds and use eggs as ranged attacks\n- Glide mechanic for advanced movement and exploration\n- Challenging traps, enemies, and hidden secrets\n- Retro pixel art visuals with 8-bit inspired music",
